<http://data.silknow.org/object/952cd129-e760-3819-963a-096f5a2f975d>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Piece of compound satin; deep green with secondary yellow weft, satin background with elaborate symmetrical heraldic design in plain cloth weave; symbols are Humilitas crowned, unicorn with flying scarf, camel-- lying in a basket-- bearing leaves or feathers on its back, beribboned frame, serpent swallowing figure, pyramided mounds surmounted by sun, and three interlocking rings on background design of scrolling foliage; right selvedge present."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/bc1058be-0fbd-3418-a3e5-c28bc5d5aa0a> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Piece of compound satin; deep green with secondary yellow weft, satin background with elaborate symmetrical heraldic design in plain cloth weave; symbols are Humilitas crowned, unicorn with flying scarf, camel-- lying in a basket-- bearing leaves or feathers on its back, beribboned frame, serpent swallowing figure, pyramided mounds surmounted by sun, and three interlocking rings on background design of scrolling foliage; right selvedge present."@en ;
